# Cursor & Windsurf AI Rules for Developer Portfolio CMS

You are assisting on Manthan Ank's Next.js 15 developer portfolio and full-stack project suite.

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router
- React 19
- TypeScript (Strict Mode)
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion
- gray-matter for MDX processing
- @vercel/analytics & @vercel/speed-insights

## Code Conventions
- Always write type-safe code using TypeScript interfaces.
- Prefer Server Components (`RSC`) for data fetching; add `'use client'` only when using hooks, browser APIs, or Framer Motion.
- All forms must validate inputs before sending requests to route handlers (`app/api/*`).
- Style using Tailwind utility classes adhering to the slate/indigo/purple dark theme.
- Never hardcode API keys or secrets in source files; use `.env.local`.

